## Secondary Axis Synchronization

What to test:

- Toggle a legend item and confirm the secondary axis domain updates with an animation.
- Hover the chart and verify tooltips highlight the matching category and series across both charts.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Secondary Axis Synchronization" name="secondary-axis-sync" type="generated" /%}

## Multiple Horizontal Series Per Chart

What to test:

- Hover one chart and confirm the matching category highlights in the other.
- Toggle a series via the legend and check both charts re-align on the shared axes.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Multi-Horizontal-Series Synchronization" name="multi-series-horizontal-sync" type="generated" /%}

## Multiple Series Per Chart

What to test:

- Hover one chart and confirm tooltips and highlights sync across both.
- Toggle a series and verify shared axis domains stay aligned.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Multi-Series Synchronization" name="multi-series-sync" type="generated" /%}

